  "description": {
   "en": "Sasaki, a member of an occult club, is told by his junior colleague Kurihara about the existence of a certain blog. The blog has many \"pictures\" drawn by the blogger's wife, \"Yuki.\" A chilling story that unravels the mystery hidden in nine pictures! When the mystery is solved, all the incidents will be connected.\n\n---\nNote: Based on the popular novel written by Uketsu, author of \"Hen na Ie.\""
